// Red-dot sight — a simple reflex optic that clusters the in-cone draw toward centre (raises
// the weapon's Accuracy). GTW-549's headline lever in its plainest form: a sight boosts AIM,
// NOT stability (a smaller bump than the `scoped_sight` precision optic). The magnitude lives
// HERE on the item, never in global tuning. Referenced by a weapon BY KEY (`red_dot_sight`) in
// its `attachments:` list; the effect is applied to the spawned weapon post-spawn.
(
    display_name: "Red-Dot Sight",
    slot: Sight,  // GTW-554: occupies the sight dovetail — fits only a weapon declaring a Sight slot
    effects: [
        Aim(0.25),  // +0.25 to the weapon's Accuracy concentration exponent (tunable)
    ],
)
